---
import { relay } from '../../data/site';
import { rootPath } from '../../utils/rootPath';

const plantLibraryUrl = new URL('/plants', relay.signInUrl).href;
const signupUrl = relay.signupUrl;
const productsHref = rootPath('/products');
---

<section id="miri-relay" class="section_layout507">
  <div class="padding-global">
    <div class="container-medium">
      <div class="padding-section-medium">
        <div class="layout507_component">
          <div class="margin-bottom margin-xlarge">
            <div class="text-align-center">
              <div class="margin-bottom margin-xxsmall">
                <h2 class="heading-style-h2">Our Products</h2>
              </div>
              <p class="text-size-medium-smallspace text-color-grey">
                Focused tools that connect to the Aspire data your team already maintains.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="layout507_card home-products_card">
            <div class="home-products_figure">
              <div class="home-products_spotlight">
                <p class="home-products_spotlight-label">FEATURE SPOTLIGHT</p>
                <h3 class="home-products_spotlight-title">Service Notifications</h3>
              </div>
              <figure class="mk-chat">
                <div class="mk-chat__head">
                  <span class="mk-chat__avatar" aria-hidden="true">R</span>
                  <span class="mk-chat__who">
                    Northside Landscape
                    <span class="mk-chat__meta">Tomorrow · 3 services · 1 text</span>
                  </span>
                </div>
                <div class="mk-chat__body">
                  <p class="mk-chat__bubble mk-chat__bubble--out">
                    Hi Dana, just a reminder that your Routine Maintenance, Spring Clean, and Round 3 Turf Application are scheduled for tomorrow. Thank you!
                  </p>
                  <p class="mk-chat__stamp">Scheduled for 4:00 PM today</p>
                </div>
              </figure>
            </div>

            <div class="layout507_card-content center">
              <div class="layout507_card-content-top">
                <h3 class="heading-style-h6 home-products_eyebrow">Miri Relay</h3>
                <div class="margin-bottom margin-small">
                  <h3 class="heading-style-h3">Extend What’s Possible with Aspire</h3>
                </div>
                <p class="text-size-medium text-color-grey">
                  Relay is a growing suite of tools built around the Aspire data your team already maintains, helping you improve communication, streamline recurring work, and get more value from the software your business already relies on.
                </p>
                <ul class="home-products_list">
                  <li><svg class="home-products_icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20 4c-7-2-15 1-15 8a6 6 0 0 0 6 6c7 0 9-7 9-14Z"/><path d="M4 21 14 11"/></svg><strong>FREE PLANT LIBRARY</strong>Browse 15,000+ plants, save reusable palettes, create client PDFs, and build Aspire-ready item sheets.</li>
                  <li><svg class="home-products_icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M21 11a8 8 0 0 1-8 8H7l-4 3V7a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h6a8 8 0 0 1 8 8Z"/><path d="M8 9h8M8 13h5"/></svg><strong>ADVANCED SMS COMMUNICATION</strong>Turn Aspire schedules and contact data into service notifications, customer updates, and team messages.</li>
                  <li><svg class="home-products_icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m10 3 2.5 6.5L19 12l-6.5 2.5L10 21l-2.5-6.5L1 12l6.5-2.5L10 3ZM20 2v6m-3-3h6"/></svg><strong>BUILT TO EXPAND</strong>Relay is growing with new tools for invoice reminders, proposal follow-ups, recurring workflows, role-based reporting, AI insights, and more.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="margin-top margin-medium">
                <div class="button-group">
                  <a href={signupUrl} class="button-2 w-button" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                    Create an account
                  </a>
                  <a href={productsHref} class="button-2 is-secondary w-inline-block">
                    <div>Learn more</div>
                  </a>
                  <a href={plantLibraryUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="button-2 is-secondary w-inline-block">
                    <div>Open Free Plant Library</div>
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
